ur-business-on-wikipedia#article\",\"headline\":\"How to Get Your Business on Wikipedia\",\"description\":\"A realistic guide to getting a business represented on Wikipedia, including eligibility, source requirements, neutral writing, and responsible next steps.\",\"url\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/blog/how-to-get-your-business-on-wikipedia\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/blog/how-to-get-your-business-on-wikipedia#webpage\"},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#organization\",\"name\":\"MIQ LLC\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#organization\",\"name\":\"MIQ LLC\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/favicon.svg\"}},\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-10\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-10\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#website\"},\"keywords\":[\"how to get your business on Wikipedia\",\"business Wikipedia page\",\"Wikipedia page creation\",\"Wikipedia notability for companies\",\"Wikipedia consulting\"],\"hasPart\":{\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can every business get on Wikipedia?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. A business generally needs sufficient independent, reliable coverage to meet Wikipedia’s notability and verifiability expectations. Many legitimate businesses do not yet meet those standards.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does it take to get a business on Wikipedia?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"There is no fixed timeline. Time depends on source availability, article readiness, the drafting/review path, and independent editorial decisions. Any promise of a guaranteed timeframe or outcome should be treated cautiously.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can MIQ LLC guarantee a Wikipedia page for my business?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. MIQ LLC does not guarantee Wikipedia publication, approval, ranking, or retention. We provide consulting, notability research, article preparation guidance, and editorial support focused on responsible process.\"}}]}}24:[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebPage\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/blog/how-to-get-your-business-on-wikipedia#webpage\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How to Get Your Business on Wikipedia\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"A realistic guide to getting a business represented on Wikipedia, including eligibility, source requirements, neutral writing, and responsible next steps.\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/blog/how-to-get-your-business-on-wikipedia\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#website\\\"},\\\"about\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#organization\\\"},\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\"}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Insights\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/blog\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"How to Get Your Business on Wikipedia\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/blog/how-to-get-your-business-on-wikipedia\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2e\"}}]],\"$L2f\",\"$L30\"]\n27:null\n2d:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"How to Get Your Business on Wikipedia | MIQ LLC | MIQ LLC\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"A realistic guide to